<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the first day of the</p>
<p>first test between England and Australia on Thursday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Butcher b Malcolm	  7</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Gough			 6</p>
<p> G.Blewett c Hussain by Gough	  7</p>
<p> M.Waugh b Gough			   5</p>
<p> S.Waugh c Stewart b Caddick	  12</p>
<p> M.Bevan c Ealham b Malcolm	    8</p>
<p> I.Healy c Stewart b Caddick	   0</p>
<p> J.Gillespie lbw b Caddick	     4</p>
<p> S.Warne c Malcolm b Caddick	  47</p>
<p> M.Kasprowicz c Butcher b Caddick   17</p>
<p> G.McGrath not out			 1</p>
<p> Extras (w-2 nb-2)			 4</p>
<p> Total (31 overs)			118</p>
<p>    Wicketfalls: 1-11 2-15 3-26 4-28 5-48 6-48 7-48     8-54</p>
<p>9-110.</p>
<p>Bowling: Gough 10-1-43-3, Malcolm 10-2-25-2, Caddick</p>
<p>11.5-1-50-5.</p>
<p>England first innings</p>
<p> M.Butcher c Healy b Kasprowicz	 8</p>
