<p>Wicketfalls: 1-8 2-16 3-50.</p>
<p>To bat: J.Crawley, M.Ealham, D.Gough, R.Croft, A.Caddick,</p>
<p>D.Malcolm.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 14-3-57-1, Kasprowicz 15-3-38-1, Gillespie</p>
<p>10-1-48-1, Warne 14-3-44-0, Bevan 2-0-10-0, S.R. Waugh 1-1-0-0</p>
<p>Australia won toss.</p>
